> 本文件参考 Python 官方模板，并补充 AI/深度学习项目的常见忽略项。

# ---- Byte-compiled / cache ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# ---- Distribution / packaging ----
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
wheels/

# ---- Virtual environments ----
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---- Jupyter ----
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints

# ---- Environment & secrets ----
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# ---- Data (原始/中间数据不入库) ----
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite3

# ---- Model weights & checkpoints ----
models/**/*.pt
models/**/*.pth
models/**/*.bin
models/**/*.safetensors
models/**/*.onnx
models/**/*.h5
models/**/*.ckpt
*.pth
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.gguf

# ---- Training logs / experiment trackers ----
runs/
logs/
outputs/
lightning_logs/
wandb/
mlruns/
.tensorboard/
*.log

# ---- IDE / editors ----
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- MyPy / pytest / coverage ----
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
